pub const PROJECT_REFERENCES_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION: &str =  "## **7. References**\n\n- List all the references used in the project, including academic papers, books, articles, and online resources.\n- Follow the appropriate citation style (APA, MLA, Chicago, etc.) for consistency and accuracy.\n";

pub const PROJECT_REFERENCES_PLAIN_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION: &str = "Compile a comprehensive reference list for the Graduation Project Report using APA citation guidelines.\n- Include every source mentioned in the report, ensuring each entry is complete and accurate.\n- Arrange all references alphabetically by the author's last name.\n- For each reference, incorporate the following details where applicable:\n\n - **List the authors**: Include last names and initials of all authors.\n - **Specify the year of publication**: Indicate the year the work was published.\n - **Provide the title of work**: Include the full title of the book, article, or website.\n - **Include journal information (for articles)**: Add the journal's name, volume number, issue number, and page range.\n - **Mention publisher information (for books)**: Note the publisher's name and location.\n - **Provide website information (for online sources)**: Include the URL and the date the site was accessed.\n\n- Ensure all references are formatted consistently according to APA standards, checking for any missing details or errors.";
